1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,780
Welcome to this short lecture on gradient descent.
欢迎来听这节讲梯度下降的短课。

2
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:06,680
Gradient descent is the workhorse algorithm behind modern deep
learning.
梯度下降就是现代深度学习背后的主力算法。

3
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:15,120
The idea is simple. We compute the gradient of the loss with respect to
the parameters. And then we take a small step in the opposite
direction.
思路很简单。我们算损失对参数的梯度。然后朝反方向走一
小步。

4
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:18,240
We repeat this process until the loss stops improving.
我们重复这个过程，直到损失不再改善。

5
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:23,360
The learning rate controls how big each step is. If the learning rate
is too large.
学习率控制每一步迈多大。如果学习率太大。

6
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:27,940
Training can diverge. If it is too small, training becomes very slow.
训练会发散。如果太小，训练会变得非常慢。

7
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:31,280
In practice we rarely use the exact gradient.
实际做的时候，我们很少用精确的梯度。

8
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:34,260
Stochastic gradients trade exactness for speed.
随机梯度用精确性换速度。

9
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:40,560
Momentum and adaptive methods smooth the trajectory, and learning rate
schedules start large and decay over time.
动量法和自适应方法会让轨迹更平滑，学习率调度一开始设
得大，然后随时间慢慢衰减。

10
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:46,980
In the next lecture, we will derive the gradient for a linear model,
and implement the update rule and code.
下一讲，我们会推导线性模型的梯度，并实现更新规则和代
码。

11
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:50,760
We will also visualize the loss surface and the optimization path.
我们还会把损失曲面和优化路径可视化。

12
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:52,120
Thanks for watching.
感谢观看。
